\" class=\"svgicon icon_comment\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\" /></svg>Comments</a></li><li class=\"devlog_link\"><a class=\"action_btn\" href=\"https://dragonkinstudios.itch.io/monastery-ora-et-labora/devlog\"><svg role=\"img\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.1\" stroke-width=\"2\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" class=\"svgicon icon_news\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"3\" width=\"22\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg>Devlog</a></li><li><a href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/3388639/monastery-ora-et-labora\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\" data-label=\"related_btn\"><svg role=\"img\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" version=\"1.1\" stroke-width=\"2\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_lato\"><div class=\"header align_center has_image\" id=\"header\"><img alt=\"Monastery: Ora et Labora\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIwMjMzNDE4LmpwZw==/original/iKkIbc.jpg\"/><h1 class=\"game_title\" itemprop=\"name\">Monastery: Ora et Labora</h1></div><div id=\"view_game_4541440\" class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget\"><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable game</p></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p><strong>Monastery: Ora et Labora</strong>&nbsp;is a management game where you build and manage a medieval monastery. As the newly appointed abbot, your journey begins in a peaceful medieval monastery, where you\u2019ll guide your monks through the sacred rule of &quot;Ora et Labora&quot;&mdash;pray and work. Oversee their daily lives as they perform divine offices, brew the finest ales, and illuminate intricate manuscripts, all while carefully managing the monastery&#x27;s resources. Face the trials of medieval life, from harsh weather to the looming threat of war, and make critical decisions to safeguard your community&#x27;s future. Customize and expand your monastery, meet the needs of your growing brotherhood, and become a beacon of hope in a world seeking guidance. Your legacy awaits&mdash;will you rise to the challenge?</p>\r\n<p>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIwMjMzODEyLnBuZw==/original/NAEh0q.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<figure><img style=\"background-color: var(--itchio_white_back); color: inherit; font-size: inherit\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIwMjI5Njg4LmdpZg==/original/GHCXJZ.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\r\n<p>Oversee the monastery\u2019s vital resources, including food, water, herbs, and tools. Balance the production and consumption of these resources to ensure the community thrives, all while adhering to the monastic values of simplicity and self-sufficiency.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIwMjMzODI0LnBuZw==/original/RnCCAI.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIwMjI5NzM0LmdpZg==/original/3CpBXJ.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p>Expand and personalize your monastery by constructing new rooms and adding decorative elements. Each addition not only enhances the monastery\u2019s functionality but also reflects the spiritual beauty and tranquility of monastic life.<br></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIwMjMzODI2LnBuZw==/original/xPpyRa.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIwMjI5ODA5LmdpZg==/original/1hh315.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\r\n<p>Lead your monks in prayer to influence life in the monastery and the world around it. Devoted prayers can prevent bad events, bring good fortune, and create a positive atmosphere. By focusing on prayer, you can help guide the community toward peace and prosperity.\r\n</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIwMjMzODI4LnBuZw==/original/QC%2BDHP.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIwMjI5ODIyLmdpZg==/original/JhJIzE.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>\r\n<p>Assign your monks to various tasks like farming, crafting, and brewing. Each monk&#x27;s work helps the monastery grow and thrive. Plan their duties carefully to make the most of their skills and meet the needs of the community.</p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIwMjMzODI5LnBuZw==/original/cc6csK.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIwMjI5ODU5LmdpZg==/original/gD%2FLVt.gif\" loading=\"lazy\"><br></p>\r\n<p>Face unexpected challenges and opportunities that arise from both within and outside the monastery. From harsh weather and visiting pilgrims to spiritual crises and moral dilemmas, your decisions will shape the future of your monastic community.</p>\r\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://discord.gg/U5zRhCuWRC\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzIwMjQyMTU2LnBuZw==/original/mGdHyt.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><br></p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg width=\"12\" height=\"6\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick